      "source": "Provider for synchronous stateless MCP prompt methods.\n\nThis provider creates prompt specifications for methods annotated with\n<a href=\"../../McpPrompt.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.ai.mcp.annotation\"><code>McpPrompt</code></a> that are designed to work in a stateless manner using\n<code>McpTransportContext</code>.",
